  including the `ChartContainer` title / subtitle / ariaLabel, the `dataColumns`
  headers, and the tooltip series name). The remainder back the native state envelope
  (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty / error chrome) and the chart's
  accessibility summary.
*/

